WEBVTT

01:58.040 --> 01:59.120
Mr. Shen.

02:02.520 --> 02:05.200
I didn't know Eldest Princess
was having such an exciting time here.

02:05.720 --> 02:07.240
I should have come earlier.

02:09.280 --> 02:12.640
Duke Su, His Majesty ordered me
to entertain the students.

02:13.360 --> 02:14.800
What's it got to do with you?

02:14.880 --> 02:17.320
If Your Highness
only uses arrows without arrowheads,

02:17.400 --> 02:18.560
then it's none of my business.

02:19.400 --> 02:20.960
But Your Highness wanted the arrowheads.

02:21.560 --> 02:23.560
Your eunuchs had no say in the matter,

02:23.640 --> 02:25.800
so of course someone would inform me.

02:25.880 --> 02:28.160
It seems you're trying to get in my way.

02:28.880 --> 02:30.040
How would I dare to?

02:30.120 --> 02:32.120
I've been ordered
to keep the palace banquet safe.

02:33.360 --> 02:34.960
Having some fun after drinking is fine.

02:35.520 --> 02:37.680
Mr. Shen stood firm though

02:37.760 --> 02:40.720
and dared to say, "Don't worry
whether I live or die."

02:40.800 --> 02:42.600
But how am I going to explain

02:42.680 --> 02:44.880
to His Majesty if someone dies?

02:44.960 --> 02:48.840
That means you must spoil my fun.

02:48.920 --> 02:50.000
It's my duty.

02:51.160 --> 02:54.160
If Your Highness wants to enjoy yourself,
please get His Majesty's permission.

02:54.880 --> 02:56.160
If His Majesty approves,

02:56.240 --> 02:57.840
I'll open the armory,

02:57.920 --> 02:59.920
bring Your Highness all the arrowheads,

03:00.000 --> 03:02.680
and join you in a bloodbath.

03:02.760 --> 03:05.160
Duke Su, you're so devoted to your duty.

03:05.240 --> 03:07.080
I'll surely tell Prince Cheng about it

03:07.680 --> 03:10.280
and ask him

03:10.360 --> 03:11.960
to take care of your work.

03:12.040 --> 03:13.600
I'm willing
to share His Highness's worries.

03:34.240 --> 03:35.200
Thank you, Duke Su.

03:42.360 --> 03:43.680
Do you think you've mastered it?

03:47.120 --> 03:47.960
I…

03:49.440 --> 03:50.360
I'm sorry.

03:52.040 --> 03:53.160
His Majesty wants you all

03:54.240 --> 03:55.360
to have a good time.

04:13.280 --> 04:14.200
I'm sorry,

04:16.120 --> 04:17.000
Mr. Shen.

04:17.079 --> 04:18.160
It's all right.

04:46.560 --> 04:47.480
Xue Li.

04:48.160 --> 04:50.000
I have no choice.

05:02.760 --> 05:03.720
Kill her.

05:17.400 --> 05:18.560
Xue Fangfei,

05:19.400 --> 05:23.360
I could crush you as if you were an ant.

05:29.960 --> 05:30.840
Jiang Li.

05:37.800 --> 05:38.640
I'm sorry.

05:39.720 --> 05:41.720
I just felt like you were about to fall.

05:41.800 --> 05:42.680
I'm fine.

05:45.120 --> 05:47.000
I just wanted to get some air.

05:47.080 --> 05:48.080
Don't take it to heart.

05:48.880 --> 05:50.560
Princess Wanning went too far indeed.

05:50.640 --> 05:53.080
Besides, you're the daughter
of Chancellor Jiang.

05:53.160 --> 05:54.400
She won't dare do anything to you.

05:55.040 --> 05:56.160
Let me walk with you.

05:56.840 --> 05:58.200
We'd better go back first.

05:58.280 --> 06:01.600
It's not good for people
to see us by ourselves.

06:01.680 --> 06:02.880
Sorry for being inappropriate.

06:17.880 --> 06:19.480
Mr. Ye, where have you been?

06:20.200 --> 06:22.600
- Come, have a drink.
- Come on. Let's drink.

06:23.560 --> 06:24.600
Quick.

06:24.680 --> 06:25.720
Come.

06:49.560 --> 06:52.400
SEE YOU IN YUXIU PAVILION
BY THE EAST GATE BEHIND THE GARDEN

06:52.480 --> 06:53.400
ZHOU YANBANG

07:13.840 --> 07:14.680
Jiang Li,

07:16.880 --> 07:20.200
you were so brave
in front of Eldest Princess earlier.

07:20.280 --> 07:21.800
I'd like to make a toast to you.

07:21.880 --> 07:24.480
Yu'e, I can't hold my liquor.

07:25.160 --> 07:26.760
I've had enough. I can't drink anymore.

07:27.560 --> 07:28.920
We're sisters,

07:29.000 --> 07:29.960
so we have a close bond.

07:34.480 --> 07:36.000
Why don't I have tea instead of liquor?

07:36.080 --> 07:38.880
Jiang Li, if you drink tea instead,

07:38.960 --> 07:42.720
you'll be letting me down
my sincere desire to get along with you.

07:51.440 --> 07:52.360
If that's the case,

07:52.920 --> 07:54.800
I'll drink the liquor.

08:25.440 --> 08:26.720
Jiang Li.

08:26.800 --> 08:27.840
Yu'e.

08:28.880 --> 08:30.000
I'm feeling

08:30.880 --> 08:31.800
a bit dizzy.

08:32.440 --> 08:33.600
Sit down first.

08:33.679 --> 08:34.520
All right.

09:18.440 --> 09:20.120
QIONGYU PAVILION

09:42.840 --> 09:45.720
SEE YOU IN YUXIU PAVILION BY THE EAST
GATE BEHIND THE GARDEN, ZHOU YANBANG

09:46.640 --> 09:48.080
How dare you have a secret meeting?

09:48.720 --> 09:49.880
I'll expose you.

09:54.920 --> 09:57.880
What can a note prove?

10:47.560 --> 10:48.920
There are a few tea rooms here

10:49.000 --> 10:51.400
specially arranged by Consort Li
for you to rest.

10:56.200 --> 10:58.720
Mr. Ye, you can rest here for a while.

10:58.800 --> 11:00.280
I'll go and get some refreshments.

11:22.400 --> 11:24.520
Ye Shijie, sober up.

11:26.880 --> 11:29.280
- You're not drunk.
- The Ye family does business.

11:29.920 --> 11:31.160
We often drink a lot.

11:31.640 --> 11:33.680
Among those who came
to congratulate me today

11:33.760 --> 11:34.920
some offered a toast,

11:35.000 --> 11:36.320
others just pretended to drink.

11:37.280 --> 11:38.200
I can hold my liquor

11:39.600 --> 11:41.040
and I didn't drink too much today.

11:41.120 --> 11:43.360
I just pretended to be drunk
to see what their intentions were,

11:43.440 --> 11:44.880
then I was brought here.

11:44.960 --> 11:45.800
But just now, you…

11:45.880 --> 11:47.320
I was just trying to wake you up

11:47.920 --> 11:49.040
because you were asleep.

11:57.560 --> 11:58.880
Why did they

11:58.960 --> 11:59.920
bring us here?

12:00.000 --> 12:01.200
Should I say you're smart

12:02.080 --> 12:03.200
or stupid?

12:03.280 --> 12:05.840
What else happens when a man
and a woman are alone in a room?

12:07.160 --> 12:08.920
They want us
to sleep together after drinking.

12:09.000 --> 12:10.000
Don't talk nonsense.

12:10.080 --> 12:11.960
I'm just trying to tell you
their intentions.

12:12.040 --> 12:13.000
So are they doing this

12:13.720 --> 12:15.560
to match us up?

12:16.400 --> 12:17.600
Don't you get it?

12:17.680 --> 12:18.920
They drugged you

12:19.000 --> 12:20.360
to make us sleep together,

12:20.440 --> 12:21.880
thereby ruining my reputation

12:21.960 --> 12:23.800
and the Ye family's future
in the officialdom.

12:23.880 --> 12:25.160
After all, His Majesty just appointed you

12:25.240 --> 12:26.920
as the Ministry of Revenue's
Vice Director.

12:27.000 --> 12:28.800
- Kill two birds with one stone?
- Yes.

12:29.480 --> 12:32.280
You didn't fall for it. Neither did I.

12:33.440 --> 12:35.000
What would you do if I really

12:36.080 --> 12:36.920
got drunk tonight?

12:37.000 --> 12:37.840
It will be fine.

12:37.920 --> 12:40.520
If that happens, I'll stab you

12:40.600 --> 12:41.680
and get out of here.

12:42.360 --> 12:44.760
People will just think
there's an assassin in the palace.

12:44.840 --> 12:46.280
Can you truly bring yourself to do that?

12:46.880 --> 12:49.160
It may be selfish of me to say this,

12:49.240 --> 12:51.400
but you won't understand
until you've been through it.

12:51.480 --> 12:54.160
If you've lost your virtue,
you'll be denounced by all.

12:55.080 --> 12:56.000
Anyone,

12:56.880 --> 12:58.760
even the vile,

12:58.840 --> 13:01.520
can humiliate you and spit on you.

13:01.600 --> 13:04.600
Even if you have a great grievance,
you can't express it.

13:04.680 --> 13:08.000
You are my cousin
and I'd feel guilty for hurting you.

13:08.960 --> 13:09.920
But I'll never

13:10.400 --> 13:11.920
get myself into that situation.

13:15.360 --> 13:16.200
Where are you going?

13:17.920 --> 13:19.600
The people outside are gone.

13:19.680 --> 13:21.920
If we don't leave, shall we wait
to be caught in the act?

13:22.000 --> 13:23.720
But if you appear before them now,

13:24.280 --> 13:25.960
they'll know that their plan failed.

13:26.040 --> 13:27.080
I'll find a place to hide.

13:28.320 --> 13:29.600
Find a hiding place too.

14:28.840 --> 14:30.280
I thought you weren't coming.

14:32.200 --> 14:33.080
I didn't expect

14:34.040 --> 14:35.280
that you'd like me indeed.

14:39.680 --> 14:42.320
Li'er, I really want to marry you.

14:54.200 --> 14:56.160
You really are a rose with thorns.

15:15.600 --> 15:16.600
Duke Su,

15:16.680 --> 15:17.880
why are you here?

15:17.960 --> 15:19.040
If I'm not here,

15:19.680 --> 15:20.640
shall I follow you

15:20.720 --> 15:23.080
to see you and Mr. Ye
sleep together after drinking?

15:23.160 --> 15:24.520
You're spying on me again.

15:24.600 --> 15:26.280
I've been ordered to guard the palace.

15:27.080 --> 15:29.200
I know where

15:29.680 --> 15:30.680
you all are.

15:35.360 --> 15:37.600
- Why did you want to kill Shen Yurong?
- I didn't.

15:37.680 --> 15:40.160
Have you forgotten
that I taught you archery?

15:40.240 --> 15:41.720
There are so many people tonight.

15:41.800 --> 15:44.560
I'm sure many people
are suspicious of your identity.

15:45.840 --> 15:47.280
This will cause quite a stir.

15:48.560 --> 15:49.800
How will you get out of it?

15:49.880 --> 15:50.800
Can you let go first?

15:50.880 --> 15:51.720
- No.
- You…

15:52.360 --> 15:54.640
Someone is still imprisoned
at the Ministry of Justice.

15:54.720 --> 15:57.400
You've got each other's lives
in your hands.

15:58.320 --> 15:59.600
Have you ever wondered

16:00.320 --> 16:02.840
what if another person's hand
were to reach out?

16:03.400 --> 16:04.520
What do you know?

16:04.600 --> 16:05.600
Do you think

16:06.480 --> 16:08.120
you're the one who can play me?

16:08.680 --> 16:09.840
What exactly do you know?

16:09.920 --> 16:11.080
I know nothing.

16:11.760 --> 16:13.720
I've been a judicial officer
for many years.

16:13.800 --> 16:15.880
I've been in a lot of cells
and seen a lot of torture.

16:16.360 --> 16:17.640
No one

16:17.720 --> 16:19.440
can withstand severe torture.

16:19.960 --> 16:23.320
Li, you were too impulsive tonight.

16:23.800 --> 16:26.520
How dare you say
you admire Shen Yurong in public?

16:26.600 --> 16:28.000
A shot arrow can't be taken back.

16:28.080 --> 16:30.440
Weren't you scared
when it was released from the bow?

16:30.520 --> 16:32.040
Aren't you the way to take it back?

16:40.400 --> 16:42.000
Is it that easy to use me?

16:42.080 --> 16:43.720
What will it cost me?

16:45.840 --> 16:46.720
I haven't decided.

16:46.800 --> 16:49.040
But this is the third favor you owe me.

16:49.120 --> 16:50.120
I need a lot.

16:50.200 --> 16:51.680
We'll talk about it

16:52.280 --> 16:53.200
when you can afford it.

16:56.200 --> 16:57.080
Duke Su.

16:58.880 --> 17:01.680
Do you really know where everyone

17:03.160 --> 17:04.680
in the palace is?

17:09.920 --> 17:11.119
What do you want to know?

17:14.920 --> 17:16.000
I want to know

17:16.079 --> 17:20.560
where Shen Yurong and Eldest Princess are.

17:20.640 --> 17:22.040
You've already guessed.

17:23.319 --> 17:24.400
Why are you asking me?

17:25.839 --> 17:26.760
Didn't you ask me

17:27.240 --> 17:28.880
why I was so impulsive tonight?

17:34.560 --> 17:38.040
I'm not like you, who has many informers.

17:38.120 --> 17:40.000
I can only risk my life

17:41.280 --> 17:42.520
for the truth.

17:42.600 --> 17:43.600
Is the truth

17:44.840 --> 17:45.840
that important

17:46.920 --> 17:48.200
to you?

17:48.280 --> 17:49.720
It's more important than my life.

18:12.080 --> 18:14.720
Girls, we've been eating for a long time.

18:14.800 --> 18:16.920
Why don't we go for a walk
and see the moon?

18:17.000 --> 18:18.360
- Sure.
- All right.

18:19.520 --> 18:21.800
- Good idea.
- Let's go now.

18:21.880 --> 18:22.880
- Let's go.
- Come on.

18:27.640 --> 18:30.200
I'm a bit thirsty.
Let's have a cup of tea.

18:30.280 --> 18:31.800
- Sure.
- I'm thirsty too.

18:31.880 --> 18:32.720
I'll come with you.

18:33.200 --> 18:34.040
Let's go.

18:41.800 --> 18:43.000
QIONGYU PAVILION

18:53.120 --> 18:53.960
Where are they?

18:54.520 --> 18:57.320
They've been drugged.
They couldn't have gone far.

18:57.400 --> 18:59.000
They must have gone somewhere else.

18:59.080 --> 19:00.440
Let's go over there and sit down.

19:00.520 --> 19:02.000
This table is too small.

19:02.080 --> 19:03.520
It's a bit crowded for us.

19:03.600 --> 19:06.320
Why don't we walk around
and check out the other tea rooms?

19:06.400 --> 19:07.360
Sure.

19:14.280 --> 19:16.280
YUXIU PAVILION

19:21.200 --> 19:23.960
- Look, the flowers are blooming here.
- It's so beautiful.

19:24.960 --> 19:27.200
Let's walk around there later
when we leave.

19:27.280 --> 19:28.280
All right.

19:28.360 --> 19:30.920
YUXIU PAVILION

19:34.160 --> 19:35.240
Let's go in and take a look.

19:45.520 --> 19:46.360
Jiang Li.

19:48.640 --> 19:49.600
Jiang Li.

19:57.760 --> 19:58.640
My goodness.

19:59.120 --> 20:00.520
Isn't this…

20:00.600 --> 20:02.360
Isn't this Jiang Ruoyao's fiancé?

20:02.960 --> 20:04.680
He doesn't want the legitimate daughter,

20:05.240 --> 20:07.200
but the illegitimate daughter
of the Jiang family?

20:11.720 --> 20:12.560
Why is it you?

20:15.360 --> 20:17.400
Ruoyao, I was drunk.

20:18.600 --> 20:20.280
Ruoyao, I was drunk too.

20:20.760 --> 20:21.800
Go away!

20:26.760 --> 20:29.120
You filthy woman,
how dare you seduce my fiancé!

20:29.200 --> 20:30.680
Mr. Zhou, help me!

20:30.760 --> 20:32.920
Get down from there! Get down!

20:33.560 --> 20:34.560
Get down!

20:35.360 --> 20:38.480
You bitch!

20:38.560 --> 20:39.520
Shameless!

20:40.800 --> 20:41.840
Bitch!

21:05.360 --> 21:07.320
JIANG RESIDENCE

21:10.160 --> 21:11.000
It hurts.

21:11.480 --> 21:12.720
All right. I'll be done in a minute.

21:12.800 --> 21:16.040
You apply the medicine on her face
at night, in the morning, and at noon.

21:16.120 --> 21:17.040
You keep applying it.

21:17.120 --> 21:18.000
What else do you do

21:18.080 --> 21:19.280
besides applying medicine?

21:19.360 --> 21:20.800
You can't decide major matters

21:20.880 --> 21:22.640
and we're ostracized
for everything trivial.

21:22.720 --> 21:23.880
We've suffered so much

21:23.960 --> 21:25.440
in this family.

21:25.520 --> 21:27.440
Look, your daughter's face is ruined.

21:27.520 --> 21:29.000
You're the head of our family

21:29.080 --> 21:30.280
and all you do is apply medicine.

21:30.360 --> 21:32.080
We just deserve to be bullied.

21:32.160 --> 21:33.920
Her virginity is gone
and her face is ruined.

21:34.000 --> 21:36.000
All we can do
is to swallow our grievances.

21:36.080 --> 21:37.280
If a dog was bitten,

21:37.960 --> 21:39.800
- it would even bark.
- Enough!

21:41.040 --> 21:41.960
Get out.

21:46.200 --> 21:51.200
Yu'e, our life is so hard.

21:51.280 --> 21:53.840
Mother, I don't find it hard.

21:53.920 --> 21:55.360
I want to marry Mr. Zhou.

21:56.920 --> 21:58.600
What nonsense are you talking about?

21:58.680 --> 22:01.440
Mr. Zhou is Ruoyao's fiancé.

22:02.120 --> 22:04.000
With your father's position,

22:04.080 --> 22:05.560
how can you get that chance?

22:06.280 --> 22:08.480
If you want to marry
into the Zhou family now,

22:08.560 --> 22:10.720
you'll be pushing
Ruoyao's side to their limits.

22:10.800 --> 22:12.160
By then, all of us

22:12.240 --> 22:14.040
will be in deep trouble.

22:14.120 --> 22:15.920
Ruoyao ruined my face.

22:16.760 --> 22:18.560
Zhou Yanbang ruined my virtue.

22:19.160 --> 22:21.280
No decent man will want me.

22:22.360 --> 22:24.200
Can I stay at home
for the rest of my life?

22:25.680 --> 22:27.520
Or will you send me
to Zhennv Hall, Father?

22:27.600 --> 22:28.440
You…

22:29.920 --> 22:31.280
What nonsense are you talking about?

22:35.600 --> 22:36.760
At this point,

22:37.600 --> 22:40.120
all you do is blame me.

22:41.640 --> 22:44.680
Jiang Ruoyao is the daughter
of Uncle Yuanbai, the legitimate son,

22:44.760 --> 22:46.600
so you taught me to be inferior to her,

22:46.680 --> 22:48.080
letting her humiliate me.

22:49.400 --> 22:51.160
I've been cowering until now.

22:52.200 --> 22:54.840
I see Jiang Li getting matched
with an official of the third rank.

22:56.120 --> 22:58.320
Have you ever planned anything for me?

22:58.400 --> 23:00.120
I'm one step ahead of Jiang Ruoyao now

23:00.200 --> 23:01.520
and I've overtaken her.

23:01.600 --> 23:03.280
Before Ruoyao's side comes to make a fuss,

23:03.360 --> 23:05.280
my father is trampling on me first.

23:05.360 --> 23:07.760
Why can't I marry Mr. Zhou?

23:09.320 --> 23:10.280
Yu'e, you…

23:10.920 --> 23:14.000
You're degrading yourself.

23:14.080 --> 23:15.600
You've not only destroyed your future,

23:16.080 --> 23:17.640
but also ruined the honor of our family.

23:17.720 --> 23:20.440
How can you blame your mother and me
for not planning for you?

23:20.520 --> 23:21.600
What else can I do?

23:22.280 --> 23:24.000
I'm just the daughter
of an illegitimate son.

23:24.600 --> 23:26.480
I wish my father
were the Chief Secretariat too.

23:27.080 --> 23:28.040
You…

23:34.760 --> 23:37.320
PARAGON OF KINDHEARTEDNESS

23:39.520 --> 23:41.880
You usually don't care
about your daughter,

23:41.960 --> 23:43.400
but you want to hit her today.

23:43.480 --> 23:44.960
I think our daughter's right.

23:45.760 --> 23:47.440
Because you're an illegitimate son,

23:47.520 --> 23:48.920
we're always inferior.

23:49.600 --> 23:51.960
Your legitimate brother's side.
What's so great about them?

23:52.040 --> 23:54.720
An illegitimate son.
I'm an illegitimate son, all right?

23:54.800 --> 23:55.880
It's all my fault.

23:56.520 --> 23:57.480
Pull yourself together.

23:57.960 --> 23:59.880
Now is not the time to cry.

23:59.960 --> 24:03.280
We need to find a way

24:03.840 --> 24:05.040
to get through this first.

24:05.120 --> 24:06.840
There's no escaping it.

24:06.920 --> 24:08.960
Jiang Ruoyao's marriage is ruined.

24:09.040 --> 24:11.160
Do you know how much effort
my brother's side

24:11.240 --> 24:12.800
has put into this marriage?

24:12.880 --> 24:14.280
We're safe and sound here

24:14.360 --> 24:16.600
because they haven't come to us
to settle the score yet.

24:16.680 --> 24:17.840
I don't think so.

24:18.920 --> 24:20.000
Why are you staring at me?

24:20.080 --> 24:22.320
No one can be certain about relationships.

24:22.880 --> 24:24.320
It's the Marquis's son

24:24.400 --> 24:25.680
who raped our daughter.

24:25.760 --> 24:26.880
Our daughter is the victim.

24:26.960 --> 24:29.800
How could Ji Shuran not give us justice

24:29.880 --> 24:31.160
and let Jiang Ruoyao

24:31.240 --> 24:33.000
disfigure our daughter's face?

24:33.080 --> 24:34.600
I'm going to charge there!

24:34.680 --> 24:37.240
Dear, stop causing trouble.

24:37.720 --> 24:39.360
Even if we get away with it this time,

24:39.960 --> 24:41.520
Yuanbai won't let Ruoyao

24:41.600 --> 24:43.080
and Yu'e share a husband.

24:43.160 --> 24:45.440
Shuran won't let it happen either.

24:45.520 --> 24:46.760
We'll talk about that later.

24:47.720 --> 24:48.880
The priority now

24:49.680 --> 24:51.280
is for Yu'e

24:51.360 --> 24:53.360
and Jiang Ruoyao to not be at odds.

24:53.960 --> 24:57.160
As long as they have a common enemy,

24:57.240 --> 24:59.040
it'll be easier.

24:59.120 --> 25:00.040
You mean…

25:00.120 --> 25:01.200
Jiang Li.

25:13.840 --> 25:14.760
Ms. Sun.

25:15.760 --> 25:16.600
Go

25:16.680 --> 25:19.080
and get someone to clean this place up.

25:19.160 --> 25:20.360
And get her a new set.

25:21.840 --> 25:22.720
Yes.

25:29.600 --> 25:30.640
Have you made enough fuss?

25:33.600 --> 25:35.240
I saw her as a loyal dog

25:35.840 --> 25:38.160
who wouldn't take food from anyone
no matter what,

25:38.240 --> 25:39.520
so I took her everywhere.

25:40.080 --> 25:42.880
I didn't expect her to steal my man.

25:44.280 --> 25:45.240
Mother,

25:45.320 --> 25:47.400
how could I swallow this anger?

25:47.480 --> 25:49.160
You don't think you've done enough wrong?

25:49.240 --> 25:50.720
What did I do wrong?

25:50.800 --> 25:53.240
Even if you were mad at Jiang Yu'e
for seducing your man,

25:53.840 --> 25:56.320
you shouldn't have slashed her face
in front of everyone.

25:56.400 --> 26:00.120
Take her home and close the door.
You have 1,000 ways of torturing her.

26:00.840 --> 26:02.600
Now, Jiang Yu'e's disfigured.

26:02.680 --> 26:06.360
Your father is the eldest son
of the family at home.

26:06.960 --> 26:09.600
Outside, he's a magnanimous
and kind chancellor at work.

26:10.360 --> 26:12.280
She has totally humiliated herself,

26:12.360 --> 26:15.120
so even if she cries herself to death
in front of your father,

26:15.760 --> 26:17.400
we'll still have to save her.

26:17.960 --> 26:19.880
You thought you vented your anger,

26:19.960 --> 26:22.280
but you didn't realize you'd given her
a chance to get away.

26:22.960 --> 26:25.240
She's already a dead fish,

26:25.320 --> 26:27.080
but a single inch of force

26:27.720 --> 26:29.120
is enough for her to turn over.

26:30.840 --> 26:32.680
She seduced my fiancé first.

26:33.200 --> 26:34.200
Where's the evidence?

26:34.680 --> 26:37.320
If she claimed
that Zhou Yanbang raped her,

26:37.400 --> 26:38.320
what can you say?

26:38.400 --> 26:40.000
So is it my fault

26:40.080 --> 26:41.480
that things turned out this way?

26:42.040 --> 26:43.240
Should I just stand by

26:43.960 --> 26:46.440
and watch her ruin my marriage?

26:47.760 --> 26:49.200
There's no room

26:49.280 --> 26:51.240
to continue your engagement
to the Zhou family.

26:52.120 --> 26:54.040
Your father will never allow you

26:54.120 --> 26:55.320
to marry into the Zhou family.

26:55.400 --> 26:57.920
If you insist on marrying him,

26:58.440 --> 27:00.520
the Zhou family won't dare to take you in.

27:01.080 --> 27:03.200
Whether you accept it or not,

27:03.760 --> 27:04.720
this is the reality.

27:07.120 --> 27:09.200
Karma. It must be karma.

27:09.680 --> 27:11.800
If I hadn't listened to you

27:11.880 --> 27:13.480
to set up Jiang Li and Ye Shijie,

27:13.560 --> 27:14.880
I wouldn't have gotten this karma!

27:14.960 --> 27:17.480
Now you're justified
in not handling things properly.

27:17.560 --> 27:19.560
Do you think Jiang Yu'e could have seduced

27:19.640 --> 27:21.600
Zhou Yanbang on her own?

27:21.680 --> 27:23.960
You've been engaged to Mr. Zhou
for quite some time.

27:24.040 --> 27:25.600
If she wanted to seduce him,

27:25.680 --> 27:27.160
why didn't she do it earlier?

27:27.240 --> 27:28.640
Are you saying

27:29.760 --> 27:31.000
she was used?

27:31.080 --> 27:33.680
Who do you think
is the happiest person in this family

27:33.760 --> 27:35.400
now that you and Jiang Yu'e

27:36.080 --> 27:37.600
are in such a mess?

27:39.120 --> 27:40.080
Jiang Li.

27:40.640 --> 27:42.200
If the engagement is canceled, so be it.

27:42.280 --> 27:44.360
I'll find you a better match myself.

27:44.440 --> 27:45.600
But this score

27:46.320 --> 27:48.160
must be settled with the person

27:48.720 --> 27:50.520
who really did this to you.

28:10.840 --> 28:12.040
Yuanbai, you're here too.

28:12.720 --> 28:14.160
If you have anything to say,

28:14.960 --> 28:16.000
say it now.

28:16.080 --> 28:17.160
Yuanbai.

28:17.640 --> 28:19.400
Just punish me.

28:19.480 --> 28:22.480
Get up and speak. This is inappropriate.

28:22.560 --> 28:25.000
It's my fault that Yu'e ruined
Ruoyao's engagement.

28:25.080 --> 28:26.560
I failed to teach my daughter well.

28:26.640 --> 28:27.640
I'm sorry.

28:28.680 --> 28:29.680
I deserve to be punished.

28:29.760 --> 28:32.080
You made too much of a mess yesterday.

28:32.560 --> 28:33.840
That's the palace,

28:34.360 --> 28:35.640
not your own backyard.

28:35.720 --> 28:37.280
I understand why you're angry.

28:37.880 --> 28:40.440
If this matter were to be pursued,

28:40.960 --> 28:42.800
it would be a disaster
for both of our families.

28:42.880 --> 28:44.960
They're really ridiculous.

28:45.040 --> 28:47.960
But His Majesty has not said anything.

28:48.040 --> 28:49.160
That's because they're lucky.

28:49.760 --> 28:52.320
I have reached a private agreement

28:52.400 --> 28:53.920
with Marquis of Ningyuan's wife.

28:54.640 --> 28:56.360
After all, it's a disgrace
for both families.

28:56.960 --> 28:58.600
They're trying to cover it up too.

28:59.280 --> 29:01.040
Rumors can't be stopped,

29:01.120 --> 29:03.600
but nothing more will happen.

29:03.680 --> 29:05.760
All the officials in the imperial court

29:05.840 --> 29:08.720
looked at me with mockery today.

29:08.800 --> 29:13.760
Yuanxing, if Yu'e
really has feelings for Mr. Zhou,

29:14.600 --> 29:16.600
she should've said so earlier.

29:16.680 --> 29:18.000
Why did she have to do

29:18.080 --> 29:19.440
such a shameful thing?

29:19.520 --> 29:21.240
It's my fault
for not teaching my child well.

29:22.560 --> 29:23.640
Please punish me, Mother.

29:23.720 --> 29:25.880
And your good daughter

29:26.840 --> 29:29.120
who hurt her own cousin's face.

29:29.200 --> 29:32.360
If this infamy gets out,
who'd dare to come and propose marriage?

29:33.040 --> 29:37.000
Mother, that was really Ruoyao's fault.

29:37.080 --> 29:40.320
But she and Mr. Zhou
had a deep bond since childhood,

29:40.840 --> 29:44.280
so it's understandable
that she lost her head on impulse.

29:44.360 --> 29:46.040
If Yu'e hadn't made a mistake first,

29:46.520 --> 29:47.960
Ruoyao wouldn't have acted like that.

29:48.040 --> 29:50.720
Anyway, it's all Yu'e's fault.

29:50.800 --> 29:52.680
I've brought Yu'e here today.

29:52.760 --> 29:53.680
You can punish her

29:55.000 --> 29:56.160
as you wish, Yuanbai.

29:56.240 --> 29:59.160
Ruoyao and Yu'e usually get along well.

29:59.720 --> 30:01.320
It's not like we've been close

30:01.400 --> 30:03.040
to the Zhou family for a day or two.

30:03.120 --> 30:04.720
Since Ruoyao hasn't married yet,

30:05.440 --> 30:07.440
I can see that the children

30:07.520 --> 30:08.760
got along politely.

30:09.240 --> 30:10.720
Why did Yu'e

30:11.200 --> 30:12.840
suddenly make such a mistake?

30:13.800 --> 30:15.440
If Ruoyao hadn't seen it
with her own eyes,

30:15.960 --> 30:17.320
I wouldn't have believed it.

30:17.400 --> 30:19.080
If she hadn't been set up,

30:19.880 --> 30:21.280
she

30:21.360 --> 30:25.160
wouldn't have dared to do it.

30:25.240 --> 30:26.160
Set up?

30:26.840 --> 30:28.080
Who set her up?

30:29.280 --> 30:32.200
Yu'e, it's better
if you speak for yourself.

30:33.640 --> 30:35.520
Uncle Yuanbai, Aunt Shuran,

30:36.360 --> 30:37.680
I'm not good at drinking.

30:37.760 --> 30:39.520
But on the day of the palace banquet,

30:39.600 --> 30:41.440
Jiang Li kept pushing me to drink.

30:41.520 --> 30:43.760
When I got dizzy and wanted to rest,

30:44.320 --> 30:45.840
she helped me and said

30:45.920 --> 30:47.640
she'd take me to the tea room to rest.

30:47.720 --> 30:51.080
As far as I can remember,
we walked for a long time.

30:51.760 --> 30:52.880
Now that I think about it,

30:53.680 --> 30:55.560
I'm afraid we reached that remote place.

30:56.120 --> 30:57.800
When we got to the door of the tea room,

30:57.880 --> 30:59.360
she gave me an excuse and left.

30:59.920 --> 31:01.320
I was so dizzy then and felt sick.

31:01.400 --> 31:02.400
I didn't think much of it.

31:02.480 --> 31:03.520
I just wanted to rest,

31:04.000 --> 31:05.240
so I went inside.

31:05.320 --> 31:07.080
But Mr. Zhou was there.

31:07.600 --> 31:09.200
He was also drunk

31:10.320 --> 31:12.040
and mistook me for Ruoyao.

31:12.120 --> 31:13.080
Then…

31:13.760 --> 31:16.240
- Yu'e.
- I panicked at that moment

31:16.320 --> 31:17.640
and tried my best to struggle,

31:17.720 --> 31:20.080
but I was too weak
under the influence of alcohol

31:20.160 --> 31:22.000
to resist a man's strength.

31:22.080 --> 31:24.320
Then Ruoyao appeared.

31:24.400 --> 31:25.760
If that's a remote place,

31:26.680 --> 31:28.040
why would Ruoyao go there?

31:28.880 --> 31:29.720
I…

31:29.800 --> 31:31.280
I dare not speculate.

31:31.360 --> 31:32.200
Yu'e.

31:32.280 --> 31:34.040
Say it, Yu'e.

31:34.120 --> 31:35.240
Just say it.

31:35.800 --> 31:37.240
I heard someone say later on

31:37.320 --> 31:39.520
that after Jiang Li
helped me to the tea room,

31:40.040 --> 31:41.680
she told Ruoyao

31:41.760 --> 31:43.720
that she couldn't find me.

31:43.800 --> 31:45.240
Ruoyao was worried about me,

31:45.320 --> 31:47.560
so she came to the tea room in a hurry.

31:48.160 --> 31:50.600
Then…

31:50.680 --> 31:52.320
How could this happen?

31:52.400 --> 31:53.440
It's my fault.

31:53.920 --> 31:55.280
It's all my fault.

31:55.760 --> 31:57.400
If I had known my limits,

31:57.480 --> 32:00.200
I wouldn't have received
the drinks from Jiang Li at the banquet

32:00.280 --> 32:03.240
and wouldn't have made
such a terrible mistake.

32:03.320 --> 32:05.400
Get Jiang Ruoyao and Jiang Li here!

32:05.480 --> 32:08.040
Let's get this straight
between the two families.

32:08.120 --> 32:10.840
We won't tolerate the one at fault.

32:12.000 --> 32:13.640
That day's palace banquet
was so dangerous.

32:14.360 --> 32:15.840
Fortunately, you took precautions

32:15.920 --> 32:18.080
and the investigation went smoothly.

32:18.720 --> 32:20.520
It was unexpectedly smooth.

32:20.600 --> 32:22.840
Miss, but that person

32:24.360 --> 32:25.400
is Eldest Princess.

32:26.160 --> 32:27.920
I'm afraid it's going to be even harder.

32:30.960 --> 32:32.240
I thought

32:34.200 --> 32:36.480
that the audience with His Majesty
would be a chance for me

32:39.320 --> 32:40.840
to break through the veil

32:42.600 --> 32:44.240
and make her come to me.

32:54.280 --> 32:56.000
But I never expected it

32:58.600 --> 33:00.120
to be Her Highness.

33:03.280 --> 33:07.680
No one would dare to disobey her order.

33:08.760 --> 33:11.680
Miss, you don't sympathize
with Shen Yurong, do you?

33:12.760 --> 33:15.680
Killing a wife is a mortal sin.

33:16.880 --> 33:17.880
Sympathy?

33:21.920 --> 33:23.000
He doesn't deserve it.

33:24.360 --> 33:27.760
Miss, what are we going to do from now on?

33:38.400 --> 33:39.240
My lady,

33:39.320 --> 33:41.160
His lordship wants you
to go to Wanfeng Hall.

33:41.240 --> 33:42.320
He has something to ask you.

33:47.960 --> 33:50.600
Miss, sending you a message at this time

33:50.680 --> 33:51.920
is not a good sign.

33:57.720 --> 33:58.920
The backbiter

34:00.160 --> 34:01.000
has made a move.

34:10.960 --> 34:11.800
Li'er,

34:12.600 --> 34:15.719
what exactly happened
in the palace yesterday?

34:15.800 --> 34:16.960
Father,

34:17.040 --> 34:18.360
I was drunk yesterday.

34:19.320 --> 34:20.880
May I know what you want to ask?

34:20.960 --> 34:22.159
Stop pretending.

34:22.239 --> 34:25.000
Explain what happened
between Jiang Yu'e and Zhao Yanbang.

34:26.560 --> 34:27.920
You want to ask about that, Ruoyao?

34:31.639 --> 34:33.600
Yesterday, I was a little drunk
from all the liquor

34:34.239 --> 34:35.239
Yu'e made me drink,

34:35.320 --> 34:37.679
so she helped me rest in a nearby room.

34:38.639 --> 34:40.159
I only heard

34:40.239 --> 34:42.480
about Mr. Zhou and Yu'e
when I woke up today.

34:43.040 --> 34:43.960
Nonsense.

34:44.040 --> 34:45.320
How could you not know?

34:45.400 --> 34:47.040
If you didn't set this up,

34:47.120 --> 34:47.960
how could Yu'e

34:48.040 --> 34:50.000
get into Zhou Yanbang's room?

34:50.760 --> 34:52.120
You probably deliberately

34:52.199 --> 34:53.480
lured Yu'e there.

34:53.560 --> 34:55.639
Yes. I didn't know Mr. Zhou was there

34:55.719 --> 34:57.440
until I went in.

34:57.520 --> 34:58.760
What a coincidence.

35:00.360 --> 35:03.440
Just a few moments after Yu'e
helped me into the room to rest,

35:04.160 --> 35:05.880
another man entered my room

35:05.960 --> 35:07.040
led by an eunuch.

35:07.880 --> 35:09.360
Do you know who he is, Ruoyao?

35:10.120 --> 35:11.360
How would I know?

35:11.440 --> 35:12.440
It's Ye Shijie.

35:13.920 --> 35:16.560
He was also drunk
and wanted to find a place to rest,

35:17.400 --> 35:19.920
but somehow, he was brought to my room.

35:20.720 --> 35:23.440
Luckily, although we were drunk,

35:23.520 --> 35:24.880
we both knew that it was improper

35:25.920 --> 35:27.680
for a man and a woman
to be in the same room,

35:28.320 --> 35:30.360
so we went out separately.

35:31.200 --> 35:33.440
By the way, I also heard
something interesting.

35:34.400 --> 35:35.280
Ruoyao,

35:35.360 --> 35:37.640
when you opened the door
to Mr. Zhou's room

35:38.360 --> 35:39.520
and before seeing anyone,

35:39.600 --> 35:41.400
you shouted,

35:41.480 --> 35:42.320
"Jiang Li."

35:42.880 --> 35:44.120
Why?

35:44.200 --> 35:46.040
You're talking nonsense. I didn't.

35:46.120 --> 35:49.040
The other students
who were with you that day all heard that.

35:49.880 --> 35:51.840
Why are you suddenly denying it?

35:52.920 --> 35:55.400
It's common to call the wrong name
in the heat of the moment.

35:55.480 --> 35:57.000
Don't be so nervous.

35:58.000 --> 35:59.280
Father,

35:59.360 --> 36:01.960
very shortly after I entered the room,

36:02.040 --> 36:03.000
Ye Shijie came in

36:03.480 --> 36:05.520
and we immediately went back
to our respective seats.

36:05.600 --> 36:07.240
Ye Shijie can prove

36:07.320 --> 36:08.720
that I didn't have time to send Yu'e

36:08.800 --> 36:09.920
to Mr. Zhou's room.

36:10.000 --> 36:11.400
Ye Shijie is your cousin.

36:11.480 --> 36:12.880
Of course he sides with you.

36:12.960 --> 36:15.040
Maybe you're in cahoots.

36:15.120 --> 36:16.360
I forgot about you.

36:16.840 --> 36:19.520
You said I sent you to Mr. Zhou's room.

36:20.040 --> 36:21.960
But why didn't you call
for help when he was about

36:22.640 --> 36:23.920
to do something to you?

36:24.000 --> 36:25.680
So many people walk around in the palace.

36:25.760 --> 36:27.320
If you kept calling for help,

36:27.400 --> 36:29.160
things might not have come to this.

36:29.240 --> 36:30.280
That's because

36:30.360 --> 36:31.360
if I made a noise

36:31.960 --> 36:33.040
and someone found out,

36:33.640 --> 36:35.200
it'd ruin Ruoyao

36:35.280 --> 36:36.600
and Mr. Zhou's reputations.

36:38.080 --> 36:39.160
Ruoyao,

36:39.840 --> 36:40.680
are you touched?

36:41.360 --> 36:43.320
Yu'e would rather ruin her own reputation

36:43.400 --> 36:45.600
to protect yours and Mr. Zhou's.

36:45.680 --> 36:48.120
You two are really loving sisters.

36:49.560 --> 36:50.560
Li'er,

36:51.160 --> 36:52.600
stop provoking your sister.

36:53.240 --> 36:55.960
She's more upset
than anyone else after what happened.

36:56.840 --> 36:58.360
I felt bad for her too,

37:00.200 --> 37:02.120
but I never thought I'd be slandered

37:02.200 --> 37:03.520
for all of this.

37:04.320 --> 37:07.160
Can't I say something in my defense?

37:07.240 --> 37:08.680
Stop quibbling.

37:08.760 --> 37:10.320
You're the one who's slandering us.

37:10.800 --> 37:12.800
Maybe you're already
involved with Ye Shijie

37:12.880 --> 37:14.160
during the Annual Exam,

37:14.640 --> 37:16.480
so you're using him as an excuse.

37:16.560 --> 37:17.920
If you don't trust Ye Shijie,

37:18.680 --> 37:20.120
you can't disbelieve Duke Su, right?

37:20.680 --> 37:21.880
What has he got to do with it?

37:21.960 --> 37:23.080
Father.

37:23.160 --> 37:25.520
Since Yu'e brought me to the room,

37:26.280 --> 37:28.200
I didn't know how to get back.

37:29.080 --> 37:30.600
I ran into Duke Su on the way.

37:30.680 --> 37:32.960
It was Duke Su
who brought me back to the front hall.

37:34.360 --> 37:36.640
Father, I know you want to do justice

37:37.240 --> 37:38.200
to Ruoyao.

37:38.280 --> 37:40.440
It's not a big deal to push me out,

37:41.040 --> 37:43.280
but if people know
the Jiang sisters do not get along

37:43.360 --> 37:46.000
and can slander each other
without any proof,

37:46.080 --> 37:48.360
I wonder what kind
of evil intentions they will have.

37:48.960 --> 37:50.120
Father, please consider this.

37:54.200 --> 37:55.880
Jiang Li, stop pretending!

37:55.960 --> 37:58.000
- Ruoyao.
- Uncle Yuanbai, please check clearly.

37:58.080 --> 37:59.640
You can't just let it slide.

37:59.720 --> 38:02.120
My life is so miserable.

38:02.200 --> 38:04.280
Uncle Yuanbai,
how am I going to live my life?

38:04.360 --> 38:06.560
What will happen to my daughter now?

38:09.560 --> 38:10.400
Enough!

38:14.280 --> 38:17.360
How can you fight
about such a family scandal?

38:18.800 --> 38:20.280
If word gets out

38:20.360 --> 38:22.160
that you sisters
are slandering each other,

38:22.240 --> 38:23.760
it'll be a big joke.

38:26.880 --> 38:28.160
Since it has come to this,

38:28.240 --> 38:30.280
does it matter who's right and wrong?

38:31.520 --> 38:32.720
Don't you think

38:32.800 --> 38:34.520
about what will happen to Yu'e

38:34.600 --> 38:36.000
since she has been disfigured?

38:36.080 --> 38:38.480
What should Ruoyao do after her fiancé

38:38.560 --> 38:39.800
did something like this?

38:39.880 --> 38:43.280
Mother, you're right.
I did not handle it well.

38:43.360 --> 38:45.200
I'll discuss with Yuanxing and her wife

38:45.280 --> 38:46.800
on how to resolve this.

38:46.880 --> 38:49.920
Go out and talk. Don't bother me here.

38:50.000 --> 38:50.840
- Yes.
- Yes.

39:04.760 --> 39:05.640
Jiang Li,

39:06.520 --> 39:07.480
stay.

39:15.280 --> 39:16.840
What's going on

39:17.560 --> 39:18.880
between Yu'e and Mr. Zhou?

39:22.080 --> 39:23.560
Grandmother, you adore me the most.

39:24.040 --> 39:25.520
I won't hide anything from you.

39:25.600 --> 39:28.920
Last night, Zhou Yanbang
gave me a small note.

39:29.480 --> 39:31.840
I ignored it, but fearing
that others would find out,

39:31.920 --> 39:34.760
so I kept it with me,

39:35.920 --> 39:38.440
thinking I'd dispose of it
after the palace banquet.

39:38.520 --> 39:41.240
Only when I heard about Yu'e and Mr. Zhou

39:41.320 --> 39:43.080
did I realize the note on me

39:43.160 --> 39:44.440
had disappeared.

39:45.200 --> 39:47.400
What an improper girl.

39:51.160 --> 39:52.280
Get up.

39:54.720 --> 39:56.160
Do you realize your mistake?

39:56.240 --> 39:57.680
I should have hidden the note.

39:57.760 --> 39:59.320
This matter has nothing to do with you.

39:59.800 --> 40:02.120
I'm talking about where you went wrong.

40:02.200 --> 40:03.360
Grandmother.

40:03.440 --> 40:05.240
Remember what I told you?

40:05.320 --> 40:06.360
You told me

40:07.160 --> 40:09.120
to take care of myself

40:09.200 --> 40:10.440
and my sisters in the palace.

40:11.080 --> 40:14.440
Don't keep it to myself
if anything happens.

40:14.520 --> 40:15.720
I must come back and tell you.

40:15.800 --> 40:17.080
And what did you do?

40:17.160 --> 40:18.680
Why didn't you tell me about it?

40:19.200 --> 40:20.960
You can only clarify things

40:21.040 --> 40:22.520
after you've been

40:22.600 --> 40:24.120
slandered badly.

40:24.200 --> 40:26.680
Then you must fight with the one
who slandered you.

40:28.080 --> 40:29.880
But we're a family.

40:29.960 --> 40:32.360
We share prosperity and loss.

40:32.440 --> 40:35.640
At the end of the day,
you'll have to swallow this grievance.

40:35.720 --> 40:36.840
Grandmother.

40:36.920 --> 40:38.920
Do you still not trust me?

40:39.000 --> 40:40.200
I dare not.

40:40.280 --> 40:41.920
No matter what happens in the future,

40:42.000 --> 40:43.680
you can tell me.

40:44.360 --> 40:46.880
I'm not the kind of person
who can't tell right from wrong.

40:51.360 --> 40:53.280
But this can't go unpunished.

40:53.360 --> 40:56.200
Copy the sutra ten times as a punishment.

40:56.280 --> 40:58.080
As for Ruoyao and Yu'e,

40:58.640 --> 41:01.520
they'll be punished
for copying Lessons for Women 20 times.

41:02.200 --> 41:03.400
I accept the punishment.

41:07.360 --> 41:09.920
Father, why do you want me
to marry Jiang Yu'e?

41:11.040 --> 41:13.200
Look at her status.
How is she worthy of me?

41:16.120 --> 41:16.960
What?

41:18.080 --> 41:20.960
Do you still want to marry Jiang Ruoyao?

41:21.040 --> 41:22.560
Father, I beg you.

41:22.640 --> 41:23.880
I know I was wrong.

41:23.960 --> 41:25.000
I'll apologize to Ruoyao.

41:25.080 --> 41:26.200
She'll definitely forgive me.

41:27.000 --> 41:27.840
Forgive you?

41:28.640 --> 41:29.480
Father.

41:29.560 --> 41:31.240
I can't believe
you made such a big mistake.

41:31.320 --> 41:33.840
You're in deep trouble, but you still
haven't come to your senses!

41:35.120 --> 41:37.040
Do you think you can
really marry Jiang Ruoyao?

41:39.120 --> 41:40.080
Look carefully.

41:40.160 --> 41:42.920
Jiang family already sent
the cancellation of engagement to us!

41:45.120 --> 41:47.640
Although Jiang Ruoyao
is the daughter of an illegitimate son,

41:47.720 --> 41:48.720
at this point,

41:48.800 --> 41:50.640
if no one wants to marry her

41:50.720 --> 41:53.240
and she becomes confused
and kills herself,

41:53.320 --> 41:54.720
His Majesty will be furious.

41:55.280 --> 41:57.800
Then not only would
Chancellor Jiang not spare us,

41:57.880 --> 41:59.800
but we also wouldn't be able to keep

41:59.880 --> 42:01.640
all of our ancestors' merits and titles.

42:01.720 --> 42:03.400
Do you understand?

42:03.480 --> 42:04.480
Father, but I…

42:04.560 --> 42:05.640
Listen here.

42:05.720 --> 42:07.800
How you treat Jiang Yu'e is your business,

42:07.880 --> 42:09.760
but she lost her virtue because of you.

42:10.240 --> 42:14.120
The Zhou family must give her a title.

42:27.520 --> 42:28.360
QINGNING PALACE

42:28.440 --> 42:29.840
The road was paved for you,

42:30.520 --> 42:32.760
but you took a wrong turn

42:32.840 --> 42:34.360
and let others take advantage.

42:36.480 --> 42:37.800
You're right.

42:37.880 --> 42:40.920
I'll teach Ruoyao better in the future.

42:41.880 --> 42:43.760
As long as Jiang Li
is still in the Jiang family,

42:43.840 --> 42:46.160
there will be ways to deal with her.

42:46.240 --> 42:48.760
If I hadn't smooth things over
in front of His Majesty,

42:49.600 --> 42:52.160
I'm afraid this wouldn't
have ended so easily.

42:52.640 --> 42:54.120
Thank you for your hard work.

42:56.960 --> 42:58.360
Any news from you?

42:58.440 --> 43:02.480
I heard from the imperial physician
that it'll be late a few years later.

43:02.560 --> 43:04.400
Did Father tell you to ask me that?

43:04.480 --> 43:07.840
No, it's just my own silly thought.

43:07.920 --> 43:10.240
It wasn't a silly thought at all.

43:10.320 --> 43:12.200
It's not like it's urgent.

43:12.280 --> 43:13.520
I'm older now.

43:14.360 --> 43:15.880
I'm not like I was when I was young.

43:15.960 --> 43:19.160
I've heard about the Buddha
at Tianxiang Temple,

43:19.840 --> 43:21.640
so I'm going there for some time

43:22.280 --> 43:23.480
to condition my body

43:23.560 --> 43:25.520
and pray to be blessed with offspring.

43:25.600 --> 43:27.680
If you're going to meditate,

43:27.760 --> 43:29.200
I'd like to ask you for a favor.

43:29.280 --> 43:30.880
See what you think.

43:31.520 --> 43:32.360
Tell me about it.

43:35.160 --> 43:38.120
QINGNING PALACE

43:38.200 --> 43:39.080
In that case,

43:39.640 --> 43:42.560
let me teach her some manners.
